# Local-dev settings for the mcp worker. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored).
# INVENTORY.md § 4 says who issues each of these.

# The mcp worker mints team-pinned sessions through auth's /internal/mcp-session.
# Omit this and the whole external machine surface cannot authenticate. Must match
# auth / tenancy / content / both gateways exactly.
INTERNAL_KEY=
